sparky-stereo-hardware (0.1.12) unstable; urgency=medium

  * NVIDIA's services (nvidia-persistenced, nvidia-powerd) run only while
    NVIDIA's driver is loaded, decided at every boot: a machine without an
    NVIDIA card skips them and is no longer "degraded"; a card added later
    starts them with no step, when udev loads the driver for it.

